  ],
  "description": "Engaged audio path from Roland MT-2 service notes, April 1991, first edition. The JFET bypass switching and LED are held in the effect-on state. Both Mid Freq pot sections follow one control; the G-taper controls are modeled as linear. 2N3904 models stand in for 2SC3378-GR transistors. The op-amps use 1.5 V nominal headroom from both ends of the 9 V supply.",
  "io": {
    "groundNode": "0",
    "inputNode": "in",
    "outputNode": "out"
  },
  "layout": {
    "pots": [
      "Level",
      "High",
      "Low",
      "Middle",
      "Mid Freq",
      "Dist"
    ]
  },
